                        {
                            "qNum": "Q3",
                            "globalIndex": 12,
                            "q": "<p>Write an algorithm prime(n) to check if n is prime.</p>",
                            "a": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong><br>\n          <strong>Algorithm prime(n):</strong><br>\n          1. Let list-of-divisors be the list obtained by computing divisors(n).<br>\n          2. Count the number of elements in list-of-divisors.<br>\n          3. If the count is exactly 2, report \"Prime\".<br>\n          4. Otherwise, report \"Not Prime\".</p>",
                            "hint": "",
