                        {
                            "qNum": "Q4",
                            "globalIndex": 13,
                            "q": "<p>Write an algorithm primedivisors(n) to compute the list of divisors of n that are prime numbers.</p>",
                            "a": "<p><strong>Answer:</strong><br>\n          <strong>Algorithm primedivisors(n):</strong><br>\n          1. Let list-of-divisors be the list obtained by computing divisors(n).<br>\n          2. Start with an empty list called 'prime-divisors-list'.<br>\n          3. For each number x in list-of-divisors:<br>\n          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;Execute prime(x) (from Exercise 3).<br>\n          &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;If prime(x) reports \"Prime\", add x to 'prime-divisors-list'.<br>\n          4. Report 'prime-divisors-list'.</p>",
